h></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Is the conclusion true? Does the argument prove it? If not, name the\nline that fails and give a counterexample to that line.</p>","file":"ch1/inequalities-for-sums-and-products.html"}